<figure class="chapter-visual ep-coupling-diagram">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创示意图：势导数、能量分母与电子—声子跃迁</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original diagram: potential derivative, energy denominator, and electron-phonon transition</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 820 390" role="img" aria-labelledby="ep-title ep-desc">
    <title id="ep-title">Connection between nuclear displacement, potential derivative, derivative coupling, and a one-phonon transition</title>
    <desc id="ep-desc">
      A nuclear displacement changes the electronic potential. Its off-diagonal matrix element connects two electronic states. Division by their energy separation gives the derivative coupling. Quantizing the displacement introduces phonon creation and annihilation operators.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ep-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" class="ep-coupling-diagram__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(35 38)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="215" height="92" rx="12" class="ep-coupling-diagram__box" />
      <text x="107" y="29" text-anchor="middle">nuclear displacement</text>
      <text x="107" y="55" text-anchor="middle">δRⱼα or Qqν</text>
      <text x="107" y="78" text-anchor="middle">核位移 / normal coordinate</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="263" y1="84" x2="350" y2="84" marker-end="url(#ep-arrow)" class="ep-coupling-diagram__arrow" />
    <text x="306" y="70" text-anchor="middle">linear order</text>

    <g transform="translate(365 38)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="235" height="92" rx="12" class="ep-coupling-diagram__box ep-coupling-diagram__box--accent" />
      <text x="117" y="29" text-anchor="middle">potential derivative</text>
      <text x="117" y="56" text-anchor="middle">⟨i|∂ⱼαV|i′⟩</text>
      <text x="117" y="79" text-anchor="middle">电子跃迁的 numerator</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="612" y1="84" x2="762" y2="84" marker-end="url(#ep-arrow)" class="ep-coupling-diagram__arrow" />
    <text x="686" y="68" text-anchor="middle">× zero-point amplitude</text>

    <g transform="translate(585 170)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="108" rx="12" class="ep-coupling-diagram__box ep-coupling-diagram__box--accent" />
      <text x="100" y="28" text-anchor="middle">EPC matrix element</text>
      <text x="100" y="55" text-anchor="middle">g ∝ √(ℏ/2Mω) ⟨i|∂V|i′⟩</text>
      <text x="100" y="83" text-anchor="middle">a + a†: emit / absorb phonon</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="482" y1="143" x2="482" y2="215" marker-end="url(#ep-arrow)" class="ep-coupling-diagram__arrow" />
    <text x="500" y="178">divide by ΔE</text>

    <g transform="translate(335 230)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="260" height="112" rx="12" class="ep-coupling-diagram__box" />
      <text x="130" y="29" text-anchor="middle">derivative coupling</text>
      <text x="130" y="57" text-anchor="middle">dᵢᵢ′ = ⟨i|∇R|i′⟩</text>
      <text x="130" y="84" text-anchor="middle">= ⟨i|∇RV|i′⟩ /(Eᵢ′−Eᵢ)</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(35 230)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="112" rx="12" class="ep-coupling-diagram__box" />
      <text x="120" y="29" text-anchor="middle">energy separation</text>
      <text x="120" y="57" text-anchor="middle">ΔE = Eᵢ′−Eᵢ</text>
      <text x="120" y="84" text-anchor="middle">near degeneracy amplifies d</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="275" y1="286" x2="323" y2="286" marker-end="url(#ep-arrow)" class="ep-coupling-diagram__arrow" />
  </svg>

  <dl class="ep-coupling-diagram__fallback">
    <div>
      <dt>势导数矩阵元 | Potential derivative</dt>
      <dd><code>⟨i|∂V/∂R|i′⟩</code> 是标准电子—声子 Hamiltonian 的电子部分。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>导数耦合 | Derivative coupling</dt>
      <dd>对非简并态，势导数矩阵元除以电子能量差得到 <code>⟨i|∂R|i′⟩</code>。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>声子量子化 | Phonon quantization</dt>
      <dd>normal-coordinate 振幅带来 <code>√(ℏ/2Mω)</code> 与产生/湮灭算符；这一步与能量分母是不同操作。</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>区分标准 EPC 势导数矩阵元和绝热基中的导数耦合，避免把能量分母错误地重复写入 <code>g</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> distinguish the standard EPC potential-derivative matrix element from the derivative coupling in an adiabatic basis, avoiding a duplicated energy denominator in <code>g</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>语义图必须明确：势导数是 numerator；除以 <code>Eᵢ′−Eᵢ</code> 得导数耦合；乘以零点振幅并引入 <code>a,a†</code> 得 one-phonon matrix element。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the diagram identifies the potential derivative as the numerator, division by <code>Eᵢ′−Eᵢ</code> as the derivative coupling, and multiplication by the zero-point amplitude with <code>a,a†</code> as the one-phonon matrix element.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>图示省略 Bloch 指标、q 点、声子极化、占据、屏蔽和自洽势导数。它不支持对 <code>λ</code>、<code>ωlog</code> 或 <code>Tc</code> 的材料结论。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> Bloch indices, q points, phonon eigenvectors, occupations, screening, and the self-consistent potential derivative are suppressed. The diagram cannot support a material conclusion about <code>λ</code>, <code>ωlog</code>, or <code>Tc</code>.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

